"https://wp-asso.com/?post_type=activite&p=186"},"modified":"2025-10-27T09:00:01","modified_gmt":"2025-10-27T09:00:01","slug":"par-impact-et-transition","status":"publish","type":"activite","link":"https://wp-asso.com/activite/par-impact-et-transition/","title":{"rendered":"Par impact et transition"},"featured_media":132,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"categories":[7],"class_list":["post-186","activite","type-activite","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-atelier-de-facilitation"],"acf":{"nom":"Par impact et transition","descriptif":"<p>Vous rencontrez des problématiques au sein de votre organisation ? Une stratégie interne à revoir, un projet à développer ou tout autre questionnement qui mérite un apport méthodologique extérieur ? Les facilitatrices de l'Hermitage Impact & Transitions vous proposent des accompagnements sur-mesure en fonction de vos besoins. Promis, ce sera studieux mais aussi ludique et convivial !</p>\n<p><strong>Atelier réalisable sur 2 jours</strong><br />\n<strong>Tarif : sur devis à la demande</strong></p>\n"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/activite/186","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/activite"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/activite"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media/132"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=186"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/categories?post=186"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]},"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"id":132,"date":"2025-10-26T15:41:32","slug":"whatsapp-image-2025-02-14-a-16-55-31_29c7f276","type":"attachment","link":"https://wp-asso.com/ecosysteme-innovant/partenaires/whatsapp-image-2025-02-14-a-16-55-31_29c7f276/","title":{"rendered":"WhatsApp Image 2025-02-14 à